 "remarks": "Welcome to 20 Sniffen Street, a 2 bedroom, 2.5 bath with garage and loft! The floorplan has a wonderful flow for easy living and entertaining. Eat-in-kitchen boasts granite counters and stainless steel appliances which flows into the open concept dining area and livingroom. Upstairs primary bedroom has generous closet and private full bath. Additional bedroom and another full bath complete the second floor. Need to work from home? Or extra space for playroom/media room? Third floor loft can accomodate those needs. 1 car garage, and another outdoor parking space complete this desirable townhouse. Close to public transportation, Merritt Parkway and all that Norwalk has to offer. Make your home ownership dreams a reality and move right in!",
